<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:50:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：S&amp;P 500 Has Best Week Since April 2025 on AI Rally: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Saks 如何重塑奢侈品集团典范</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-saks-is-reclaiming-luxury-as-exemplar-luxury-group-video</link><description>彭博社的 Romaine Bostick 报道了 Exemplar Luxury Group（前身为 Saks Global）自今年早些时候摆脱破产保护以来如何重塑自身，以在奢侈品领域重新开始。 Exemplar Luxury Group 首席执行官 Geoffroy van Raemdonck、FIT 副教授 Shawn Grain Carter、Telsey Advisory Group 首席执行官 Dana Telsey 以及 Exemplar Luxury Group 总裁兼首席文化官 Darcy Penick 分享了他们的想法。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-saks-is-reclaiming-luxury-as-exemplar-luxury-group-video'&gt;Saks 如何重塑奢侈品集团典范&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：How Saks Is Reclaiming Luxury as Exemplar Luxury Group&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/how-saks-is-reclaiming-luxury-as-exemplar-luxury-group-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:18:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>桑切斯呼吁西班牙人去投票，寻求不太可能获胜</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/sanchez-seeks-unlikely-win-with-plea-for-spaniards-to-go-vote</link><description>佩德罗·桑切斯在他的最后一场竞选活动中召集选民参加周日的全国大选，试图在最后一刻打破常规。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/sanchez-seeks-unlikely-win-with-plea-for-spaniards-to-go-vote'&gt;桑切斯呼吁西班牙人去投票，寻求不太可能获胜&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Sánchez Seeks Unlikely Win With Plea for Spaniards to Go Vote&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/sanchez-seeks-unlikely-win-with-plea-for-spaniards-to-go-vote</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:24:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</link><description>由于中东能源基础设施和油轮遭受袭击引发了人们对敌对行动升级的担忧，油价本月首次出现周度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27'&gt;11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 27&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:05:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>风险不断加大，哥伦比亚比索面临考验反弹的风险</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/colombia-peso-stumbles-as-mounting-risks-test-carry-fueled-rally</link><description>哥伦比亚比索正面临四年多来最糟糕的一个月，国内外的麻烦混合在一起，削弱了今年最具弹性的货币之一的光芒。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/colombia-peso-stumbles-as-mounting-risks-test-carry-fueled-rally'&gt;风险不断加大，哥伦比亚比索面临考验反弹的风险&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Colombia Peso Stumbles as Mounting Risks Test Rally&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/colombia-peso-stumbles-as-mounting-risks-test-carry-fueled-rally</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:37:27 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>